# ==============================================================================
# GOD MODE AI SWARM - 100% FREE API CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to '.env' or configure these keys in the GOD MODE UI under Settings.
# All 4 providers below offer 100% FREE tiers with NO credit card required!
#
# You only need AT LEAST ONE of the free providers below to run the live multi-agent swarm:

# 1. Google Gemini API (Recommended for Flagship Reasoning & Code - 100% FREE)
#    - Sign up & get your free key in 10 seconds: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#    - Generous free tier: 15 Requests/Min, 1,500 Requests/Day
