# 2. Groq Cloud API (Recommended for Blazing Fast 500+ tok/s Inference - 100% FREE)
#    - Sign up & get your free key in 10 seconds: https://console.groq.com/keys
#    - Generous free tier: Llama 3.3 70B, Qwen 2.5 Coder, Gemma 2 at 30 Requests/Min
