# 3. OpenRouter API (Access to 70+ Free Open-Source LLMs - 100% FREE)
#    - Sign up & get your free key: https://openrouter.ai/keys
#    - Provides DeepSeek R1, Hermes 3 405B, Mistral 7B, Llama 3.3 free models
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# 4. Hugging Face Access Token (For FLUX.1 & SDXL Image Gen + NLP - 100% FREE)
#    - Sign up & create a free "Read" token: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
#    - Enables Stable Diffusion XL, FLUX.1 Schnell image generation & BERT NLP
